# Third-party licenses

PocketAnon is licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. It links or bundles the third-party
material below. Models, fonts and native libraries that cargo-about cannot see are
listed first; the crate list is generated from `Cargo.lock` with
`cargo about generate about.hbs -o THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md`.

## Models (downloaded at runtime, not shipped in the binary)

| Registry id | Source | License | Lineage |
|---|---|---|---|
| gliner_multi_pii_v1 | https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/gliner_multi_pii-v1 | Apache-2.0 | ONNX conversion of urchade/gliner_multi_pii-v1 (Apache-2.0), fine-tuned from urchade/gliner_multi-v2.1 (Apache-2.0) on urchade/synthetic-pii-ner-mistral-v1 (Apache-2.0); backbone microsoft/mdeberta-v3-base (MIT) |
| gliner_small_v2_1 | https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/gliner_small-v2.1 | Apache-2.0 | ONNX conversion of urchade/gliner_small-v2.1 (Apache-2.0), trained on urchade/pile-mistral-v0.1 (Apache-2.0); backbone microsoft/deberta-v3-small (MIT) |

The onnx-community repositories carry no license field; they are unmodified conversions and
declare the upstream model as `base_model`, so the upstream Apache-2.0 license applies.
GLiNER v0/v1 models were CC-BY-NC-4.0 (Pile-NER); only the v2.1 line is used here.

## Native libraries and bundled assets

- ONNX Runtime 1.20 (Microsoft), prebuilt binaries fetched by `ort-sys` at build time: MIT.
- Oniguruma, bundled and compiled by `onig_sys`: BSD-2-Clause.
- Fonts in `epaint_default_fonts`: Hack (MIT), Noto Emoji (OFL-1.1), emoji-icon-font (MIT), Ubuntu Light (Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0).
- Fonts bundled by Wordcraft: Source Sans 3, Source Serif 4, Inter, JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
- Hyphenation patterns bundled by Wordcraft: en-us (public domain / CC0-1.0), pl (MIT), it (MIT), pt (BSD-3-Clause). See Wordcraft's NOTICE.

